      "updated_at": "2026-10-27T13:59:51Z",
      "body": "Generic deserialization of the outer template capture and decoded GraphQL bodies could reinterpret marker objects, fabricate typed choices/error states, and normalize numeric spellings. Use one qualified LastWins literal helper for capture, manifest and each body, then insert the admitted capture directly into projection metadata. Preserve exact body strings and existing selection/error rules. A borrowed request comparator and Number-only PageInfo adapter retain observed integer -0 compatibility without rewriting captures or accepting marker objects as scalars.\n\nVerification: all 23 tests pass (10 inherited, 13 new), with manual literal oracles, typed ID/library/body/error/PageInfo refusals, numeric neighbors, duplicates, late failure/input preservation, exact outer AND decoded-body 2M-value/depth boundaries, raw byte guards and unchanged native observations. Clippy, formatting, build, source bindings and independent review pass. Thirteen actual CLI cases preserve five whole-capture/selection routes, six established no-stdout refusals, literal/typed-zero values and a nested template-ID refusal. Ten observations/four GraphQL errors and successful empty pages remain distinct; no instantiation or corrected paging is invented.\n\nOriginal and explicit dependency-unified baselines both show two passing zero-compatibility controls/five reached literal failures; original features already included AP/raw_value. Later numeric subcases first run in final green. Physical8MiB/depth128/2Mvalues+keys/16MiBscalar admission applies independently per capture/manifest/body, not as a shared aggregate budget. Before-collapse tightening and co-bounds are explicit; existing projection/collection limits remain.\n\nTwo commits separate implementation/regressions and exact evidence: porting/rust-parity-evidence/RR23d/RESULTS.md. Base fedc8ba846ffcc2b21948b7d3ddb842c9e9f5e4a preserves exact #87 plus six unchanged qualified #100 crate blobs, with #90/#100 required. Root owns Cargo wiring and serialized offline execution. Land prerequisites, retarget/requalify; never merge into the snapshot. Original main/read_file/tests/queries/captures and historical holds are unchanged. Parent RR23 joint integration/C01 and native/UI/performance/full-feature acceptance remain OPEN. No fresh native/database epoch, registry expansion, merge or deploy.",
      "labels": []
    },
    {
      "number": 107,
